        "custom_liquid": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Gift Registry (United Kingdom)</title>\n\n<!-- Poppins font -->\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<style>\n  /* Shared Carrol Boyes styling */\n  .cb-container {\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    color: #333;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .cb-container h1, .cb-container h2, .cb-container h3 {\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 1.6em 0 0.6em;\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(10px);\n    animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease forwards;\n  }\n  .cb-container p,\n  .cb-container li,\n  .cb-container td,\n  .cb-container th {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  ul, ol { margin: 0.4em 0 1.1em 1.2em; }\n  .cb-note { font-size: 0.95em; opacity: 0.85; }\n  .cb-muted { color: #444; }\n\n  /* Links */\n  .cb-container a {\n    color: #555;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    transition: color .25s ease, text-decoration-color .25s ease;\n  }\n  .cb-container a:hover {\n    color: #000;\n    text-decoration-color: #000;\n  }\n\n  /* Callout (optional reuse) */\n  .cb-callout {\n    background:#fafafa;\n    border-left:4px solid #000;\n    padding:12px 14px;\n    margin:1.1em 0;\n  }\n\n  @media (min-width: 768px) {\n    .cb-container { padding: 3rem 2rem; }\n  }\n\n  /* Subtle fades */\n  @keyframes fadeIn { to { opacity: 1; } }\n  @keyframes fadeInUp { to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"cb-container\">\n  <h1>Gift Registry (United Kingdom)</h1>\n  <p>Create a gift registry for weddings, anniversaries, birthdays or any special occasion—tailored for friends and family shopping in the UK.</p>\n\n  <h2>How the Gift Registry Works</h2>\n  <ol>\n    <li>Create your registry online and add items from our UK catalogue.</li>\n    <li>Set your preferred delivery address and delivery-date window.</li>\n    <li>Share your registry link with guests by email, social media or invitation.</li>\n    <li>Guests purchase gifts directly from your registry; we ship to you or to them, as you prefer.</li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <h2>Creating &amp; Managing Your Registry</h2>\n  <ol>\n    <li>Sign in or create an account to start a registry.</li>\n    <li>Choose a registry name, event date, delivery address, and visibility (public/private).</li>\n    <li>Add items from product pages using “Add to Registry.”</li>\n    <li>Re-order items in priority order and add notes (e.g., quantities needed).</li>\n    <li>Enable Group Gifting for higher-value items (optional, where available).</li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <h2>Sharing Your Registry</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Copy your unique registry link to share with guests.</li>\n    <li>Use share buttons for email and social platforms.</li>\n    <li>You can update your registry at any time before items are purchased.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Purchasing Gifts (for your guests)</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Guests can purchase online using credit/debit cards via Shopify Payments or Klarna (availability subject to Klarna’s checks; 18+, UK residents, credit subject to status; late fees may apply; borrowing more than you can afford or paying late may impact your financial status and ability to obtain credit).</li>\n    <li>Guests see real-time availability and whether an item has already been purchased.</li>\n    <li>Gift messages can be added at checkout; gift wrap available where offered.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Delivery (UK)</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Courier partner: DHL.</li>\n    <li>Fees: £4.50 for orders under £50; Free delivery for orders £50+.</li>\n    <li>Highlands, Islands &amp; Northern Ireland: calculated at checkout; extended timeframes/surcharges may apply.</li>\n    <li>Timeframes: typically 2–5 working days (up to 7 during peak). Weekday deliveries only.</li>\n    <li>Tracking: recipients receive a dispatch email with tracking details.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>International Delivery for Gifts</h2>\n  <p>If a guest ships a gift to an address outside the UK, international shipping is available via DHL. Taxes and duties, where applicable, are shown at checkout before payment. Typical delivery: 8–10 working days.</p>\n\n  <h2>Address &amp; Delivery Options</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Default delivery is to the registry holder’s address set in your profile.</li>\n    <li>Guests may choose to send gifts to their own address (to bring to your event), if enabled.</li>\n    <li>You can set a delivery date window; we’ll aim to dispatch within that window (subject to stock and courier schedules).</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Out-of-Stock &amp; Substitutions</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>If an item becomes unavailable after being added to a registry, guests will be notified at checkout.</li>\n    <li>Where appropriate, we may offer a close alternative or e-gift card of equal value with your consent.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Returns &amp; Exchanges for Registry Gifts (UK)</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Your statutory rights under UK law apply to the purchaser (guest).</li>\n    <li>As a goodwill policy, registry recipients may exchange unopened, unused gifts within 30 days (proof of purchase or order number required).</li>\n    <li>For online purchases, purchasers have a 14-day right to cancel from the day after delivery and a further 14 days to return; refunds are made to the original payment method and include the standard outbound delivery charge paid at checkout.</li>\n    <li>For faulty or mis-described goods, we’ll arrange a repair/replacement or refund per the Consumer Rights Act 2015; return costs are covered by us.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Age-Restricted Gifts (UK Knife Law)</h2>\n  <p>For bladed items (e.g., knives), the recipient must be 18+. At delivery, the purchaser or named recipient may be required to present valid government-issued photo ID matching the checkout name. Couriers may refuse delivery if ID is not produced or details do not match.</p>\n\n  <h2>Payments (for Guests)</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Cards via Shopify Payments (Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Maestro).</li>\n    <li>Klarna: Pay in 3 or Pay in 30 days (availability subject to status; 18+, UK residents; borrowing more than you can afford or paying late may impact your financial status and ability to obtain credit; late fees may apply).</li>\n    <li>Other payment methods are not accepted in the UK at this time.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Gift Messages &amp; Gift Wrap</h2>\n  <p>Guests can add a complimentary gift message at checkout. Gift wrap is available on selected items (fees may apply).</p>\n\n  <h2>Privacy &amp; Data Protection (UK GDPR)</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>We process registry data to provide and manage your registry and fulfil orders.</li>\n    <li>Guest details are used for order processing, delivery and (if consented) marketing; you and your guests can update preferences or opt out at any time.</li>\n    <li>See our Privacy Notice (UK) and Cookie Policy for lawful bases, retention and your rights.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Registries are for personal, non-commercial use.</li>\n    <li>Prices and product availability may change; items are only reserved once purchased.</li>\n    <li>We may amend or end the registry service with reasonable notice, ensuring no unfair detriment to users.</li>\n    <li>Nothing in this page affects your statutory rights.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Contact</h2>\n  <p>For questions about your registry, please contact <a href=\"mailto:customercare@carrolboyes.com\">customercare@carrolboyes.com</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
